WEBVTT

00:27.160 --> 00:30.560
♪Peach blossoms fall,
yesterday's trace fades away♪

00:30.800 --> 00:34.080
♪Ahead lie storms and winds,
our fates like drifting clouds sway♪

00:34.400 --> 00:40.040
♪Alas, I roam through what remains,
fate's grip won't set me free♪

00:41.400 --> 00:44.920
♪If time would spare me
just one breath to stay♪

00:45.520 --> 00:48.920
♪If you could see
the depth of my belief♪

00:49.120 --> 00:55.680
♪Alone I enter the game,
every move made with no regret in me♪

00:56.080 --> 01:00.040
♪Though shackles bind my soul
and chain my form♪

01:00.160 --> 01:03.240
♪I've walked
through life and death before♪

01:03.320 --> 01:10.200
♪I fear not fate's cruel temptations,
I've severed every cause♪

01:10.400 --> 01:14.440
♪In this life our threads entwined,
in love and pain we crossed♪

01:14.600 --> 01:17.480
♪But I'll keep my word
no matter the cost♪

01:17.560 --> 01:19.960
♪Forged in stardust and flame♪

01:20.040 --> 01:25.800
♪I rise with an unyielding frame♪

01:35.120 --> 01:36.960
=The Princess's Gambit=

01:37.040 --> 01:39.440
(Adapted from the novel "Peach Blossoms
Reflecting the River and Mountains")

01:39.520 --> 01:42.000
(by Bai Lu Cheng Shuang)

01:42.160 --> 01:44.920
=Episode 34=

01:55.040 --> 01:56.520
Here's the confession letter you want

01:58.200 --> 01:59.440
(Confession Letter)
and

01:59.520 --> 02:01.320
the petition Xie Guanyu wrote back then.

02:01.920 --> 02:02.560
Father said

02:02.640 --> 02:04.440
it was hidden behind the plaque
in his study.

02:05.400 --> 02:06.600
I hope you will keep your word

02:07.080 --> 02:09.080
and spare the women and children
of the Meng family.

02:11.200 --> 02:12.920
I may do what it takes
to get what I want.

02:13.640 --> 02:16.040
But I won't go back on my word
like your father did.

02:28.080 --> 02:29.760
(Meng Residence)

02:46.000 --> 02:47.800
(Humility)

02:55.720 --> 02:57.520
(Petition)

02:57.600 --> 02:58.680
I will present this petition

02:59.120 --> 03:00.120
to His Majesty.

03:01.120 --> 03:02.640
He will see the truth

03:02.960 --> 03:03.760
and clear my name.

03:11.680 --> 03:14.160
(Respectfully, Xie Guanyu)

03:15.760 --> 03:16.360
(Father,)

03:17.840 --> 03:19.640
(I will restore our family's honor.)

03:21.640 --> 03:25.000
(Shen Residence)

03:28.320 --> 03:29.960
Today, not only did
Meng Zhongyan confess,

03:31.120 --> 03:33.400
but I also found the petition
my father wrote back then.

03:36.040 --> 03:36.640
Taohua,

03:38.760 --> 03:39.360
I'm sorry.

03:39.840 --> 03:40.440
I…

03:41.120 --> 03:42.800
You don't need to apologize to me.

03:43.640 --> 03:45.160
If you had not stood with Prince Wuxia

03:45.560 --> 03:47.680
to fight for your family for my sake,

03:48.520 --> 03:50.000
I wouldn't have fallen for you.

03:52.240 --> 03:52.880
You knew?

03:54.760 --> 03:55.360
Don't worry.

03:55.440 --> 03:57.440
I already sent Zhan Lu ahead
with the shadow guards

03:57.800 --> 03:59.320
to Beiyuan to search for the antidote.

04:00.600 --> 04:01.560
Once I've finished this,

04:02.280 --> 04:02.880
I'll ride

04:03.400 --> 04:04.240
to Beiyuan with you.

04:05.480 --> 04:06.360
Chancellor,

04:07.120 --> 04:09.160
just focus on clearing
your father's name.

04:09.680 --> 04:10.600
Don't worry about me.

04:11.400 --> 04:14.320
I'll head off with Zhan Lu tomorrow.

04:20.079 --> 04:21.000
But how can I not worry

04:21.920 --> 04:22.840
when you go back alone?

04:25.040 --> 04:28.080
I have Zhan Lu, Qingtai,
and the shadow guards with me.

04:28.640 --> 04:29.840
I won't be alone.

04:31.040 --> 04:32.600
Besides, Changjue sent a letter today.

04:33.240 --> 04:35.480
He said he has already gathered support

04:35.560 --> 04:37.200
from many officials

04:37.640 --> 04:39.120
in Hao City.

04:41.520 --> 04:42.520
Even Qian Mochen?

04:44.600 --> 04:46.680
Changjue did try reaching out.

04:47.080 --> 04:48.360
But Qian Mochen turned him away.

04:49.240 --> 04:51.520
Luckily, we had warned Changjue.

04:51.760 --> 04:52.720
So he stayed cautious.

04:53.080 --> 04:54.640
So Qian Mochen doesn't know where he is.

04:56.400 --> 04:57.000
Good.

04:58.560 --> 04:59.240
So

04:59.320 --> 05:00.320
don't worry.

05:00.960 --> 05:02.080
Once I reach Hao City,

05:02.360 --> 05:04.040
Changjue will help me look
for the antidote.

05:08.080 --> 05:09.000
What worries me is

05:10.040 --> 05:12.000
that you always protect Changjue

05:12.680 --> 05:14.200
and don't let him worry about you.

05:14.640 --> 05:16.120
He's my brother.

05:16.760 --> 05:18.120
Now that I need his help,

05:18.320 --> 05:19.360
I'll tell him everything.

05:19.760 --> 05:20.440
So don't worry.

05:23.720 --> 05:26.160
Then promise me
to take care of yourself.

05:27.280 --> 05:28.120
When this is over,

05:28.640 --> 05:29.960
I'll come and find you right away.

05:30.880 --> 05:32.560
I promise.

05:39.880 --> 05:40.920
Do you have confidence

05:41.280 --> 05:42.400
in tomorrow's court session?

05:44.080 --> 05:44.680
Don't worry.

05:45.480 --> 05:46.360
Everything's in place.

05:53.840 --> 05:55.240
Court is in session!

06:07.720 --> 06:09.560
His Majesty arrives!

06:10.960 --> 06:11.720
You may all leave.

06:22.480 --> 06:24.280
- Greetings, Your Majesty.
- Greetings, Father.

06:25.560 --> 06:26.160
Rise.

06:26.240 --> 06:28.360
- Thank you, Your Majesty.
- Thank you, Your Majesty.

06:30.280 --> 06:32.880
I'm feeling unwell today.

06:33.160 --> 06:34.640
Present only urgent matters.

06:39.440 --> 06:41.960
Your Majesty,
I have an important matter to report.

06:42.360 --> 06:43.280
Proceed.

06:44.280 --> 06:47.560
Your Majesty,
over several days of questioning,

06:48.360 --> 06:50.000
I've learned that in addition
to treason,

06:50.720 --> 06:53.680
Meng Zhongyan committed
another crime 18 years ago.

06:54.400 --> 06:55.760
He has written a full confession.

06:56.200 --> 06:58.280
I ask Your Majesty to allow me
to present the details.

07:03.320 --> 07:06.560
I'm not well.

07:07.280 --> 07:08.360
We'll discuss it another day.

07:08.440 --> 07:09.680
Summon the imperial physician.

07:15.680 --> 07:16.280
Father,

07:16.840 --> 07:18.280
the physician will be here shortly.

07:18.600 --> 07:19.240
Please rest.

07:19.320 --> 07:21.120
Allow me to hear the report
on your behalf.

07:22.840 --> 07:25.760
Chancellor Shen,
please proceed with Meng's confession.

07:29.320 --> 07:32.440
According to Meng Zhongyan's confession,
he orchestrated the witchcraft case

07:32.960 --> 07:34.360
eighteen years ago.

07:35.480 --> 07:37.920
He planted cursed objects
to frame Consort Shu

07:38.640 --> 07:39.640
and hid the petition written

07:39.720 --> 07:42.520
by her brother, Xie Guanyu,
the head of the Xie family.

07:43.280 --> 07:44.960
He then falsely claimed resistance

07:45.280 --> 07:47.720
and ordered the slaughter
of the entire Xie family.

07:48.200 --> 07:49.080
Why?

07:49.440 --> 07:52.520
Because Xie Guanyu had proposed
an imperial exam reform

07:52.680 --> 07:55.280
that threatened the interests
of powerful noble families like his.

07:56.240 --> 07:57.200
I found

07:57.600 --> 08:00.040
both Xie Guanyu's petition
and Meng Zhongyan's confession

08:00.720 --> 08:01.880
at the Meng residence.

08:02.200 --> 08:03.680
I shall present both to Your Majesty.

08:16.280 --> 08:16.880
Father,

08:17.680 --> 08:19.480
Meng Zhongyan deceived the throne,

08:20.000 --> 08:21.040
formed private factions,

08:21.160 --> 08:22.280
and murdered loyal subjects.

08:22.760 --> 08:24.880
His crimes cry out for justice.

08:25.440 --> 08:27.640
Please order a retrial of the case.

08:30.440 --> 08:34.280
- Please order a retrial, Your Majesty.
- Please order a retrial, Your Majesty.

08:43.919 --> 08:46.400
Are you trying to drive me to my grave?

08:47.040 --> 08:48.240
What difference is there

08:48.920 --> 08:52.440
between this and the treason
of Mu Wuyin and Meng Zhongyan?

08:53.720 --> 08:54.600
Meng Zhongyan's crimes

08:55.680 --> 08:57.240
are unforgivable.

08:58.120 --> 08:58.720
All we ask

08:59.440 --> 09:00.680
is to right what was wrong.

09:01.600 --> 09:02.840
How is that the same?

09:08.600 --> 09:09.480
Mu Wuxia,

09:10.120 --> 09:13.240
it looks like
I truly underestimated you.

09:14.240 --> 09:15.920
You're better at winning hearts

09:16.360 --> 09:19.080
than your three brothers ever were.

09:19.880 --> 09:22.440
Even Left Chancellor
now speaks up for you.

09:23.080 --> 09:23.680
Fine.

09:25.440 --> 09:26.680
Why don't I just hand my throne

09:27.400 --> 09:29.440
to you now?

09:30.040 --> 09:32.440
So you can decide
which case for retrials!

09:35.120 --> 09:35.920
Father, please wait.

09:39.840 --> 09:41.320
What now? Do you want to rebel too?

09:41.560 --> 09:42.280
I dare not.

09:43.560 --> 09:44.160
I only speak

09:44.800 --> 09:45.960
from reason.

09:47.040 --> 09:49.680
The witchcraft charges have failed
to convince the public.

09:51.040 --> 09:51.640
Fine.

09:53.680 --> 09:54.280
You

09:55.360 --> 09:56.360
and you!

09:57.000 --> 09:57.840
Stay!

09:58.040 --> 09:59.320
Everyone else is dismissed!

10:29.720 --> 10:30.840
You want to reopen the case

10:31.520 --> 10:32.960
for your mother.

10:33.800 --> 10:34.920
And you,

10:35.440 --> 10:36.280
Left Chancellor.

10:36.920 --> 10:38.160
What's your reason?

10:40.360 --> 10:40.960
I am

10:41.840 --> 10:43.200
Xie Guanyu's son,

10:44.000 --> 10:45.040
Xie Jing'an.

11:06.760 --> 11:07.680
Xie Jing'an?

11:09.360 --> 11:10.440
You're still alive?

11:11.360 --> 11:13.680
Your entire clan

11:14.280 --> 11:15.400
was executed.

11:16.560 --> 11:17.160
Yet

11:18.000 --> 11:20.040
you've hidden at my side
for over a decade.

11:20.880 --> 11:22.080
What's your motive?

11:22.560 --> 11:23.160
By law,

11:23.680 --> 11:26.360
I should have you executed
for deceiving your ruler!

11:27.080 --> 11:27.680
Father,

11:28.520 --> 11:29.880
Jing'an must have suffered greatly

11:30.280 --> 11:31.600
to survive.

11:32.200 --> 11:33.240
He has served

11:33.680 --> 11:35.240
the court loyally for ten years.

11:35.320 --> 11:37.640
He deserves recognition
for both his service and his effort.

11:37.760 --> 11:38.440
Silence!

11:40.920 --> 11:41.680
So long as I live,

11:42.440 --> 11:43.520
that witchcraft case

11:44.080 --> 11:45.480
will never be overturned!

11:48.400 --> 11:51.120
When Meng Zhongyan lied to you,
you did nothing.

11:53.080 --> 11:55.120
When noble clans schemed for power,

11:55.200 --> 11:56.240
you looked the other way.

11:57.080 --> 11:58.520
I have suffered a grave injustice.

11:59.560 --> 12:01.600
All I ask now is
to clear my clan's name.

12:02.280 --> 12:04.520
Is it that Your Majesty
can't tell right from wrong,

12:04.880 --> 12:06.560
or that you simply refuse to admit

12:06.920 --> 12:09.240
that Meng Zhongyan was only the blade
that killed my family,

12:09.400 --> 12:10.400
and you were the one

12:12.320 --> 12:14.120
who wielded it?

12:16.360 --> 12:19.440
You dare speak to me like that?

12:21.480 --> 12:22.080
Your Majesty.

12:22.720 --> 12:23.640
I've served you loyally

12:25.120 --> 12:26.360
for ten years.

12:27.320 --> 12:28.600
I rooted out traitors

12:28.960 --> 12:30.200
and went against noble families.

12:31.240 --> 12:32.600
But I am not my father.

12:33.640 --> 12:36.320
I won't let myself become
your pawn in a political game.

12:37.120 --> 12:37.840
The truth

12:38.360 --> 12:39.920
of the witchcraft case is already known.

12:41.000 --> 12:43.240
History won't lie for your sake.

12:45.000 --> 12:46.120
A hundred years from now,

12:47.760 --> 12:50.200
do you want to be remembered
as a stubborn tyrant

12:50.520 --> 12:52.000
who destroyed the loyal

12:53.080 --> 12:53.840
or

12:53.920 --> 12:55.640
a wise ruler
who could admit his mistakes

12:56.640 --> 12:58.640
and cherish his loyal ministers?

13:00.240 --> 13:00.840
Father,

13:02.440 --> 13:03.760
Mr. Li Dian is currently drafting

13:05.000 --> 13:06.920
your royal chronicle.

13:09.920 --> 13:10.520
What?

13:12.560 --> 13:14.600
Are you threatening me now?

13:15.800 --> 13:17.880
Aren't you afraid I'll execute you both?

13:21.800 --> 13:22.400
Your Majesty,

13:24.280 --> 13:25.200
what I've said today

13:26.200 --> 13:26.880
may be bold.

13:28.000 --> 13:28.640
But this will be

13:29.400 --> 13:30.640
my final counsel to the throne.

13:31.920 --> 13:32.880
What are you up to now?

13:35.160 --> 13:36.040
I will resign my post

13:37.080 --> 13:39.960
as Left Chancellor
to live among the common people.

13:41.520 --> 13:42.760
As I take my leave,

13:43.840 --> 13:45.600
I beg Your Majesty

13:49.080 --> 13:50.200
to retry the witchcraft case

13:51.080 --> 13:52.080
and clear the Xie family

13:52.880 --> 13:53.880
and Consort Shu,

13:54.840 --> 13:56.920
the mother
of the future Crown Prince Wuxia's

13:57.880 --> 13:58.520
name.

14:36.120 --> 14:40.360
(Xie Residence)

14:41.000 --> 14:42.440
(Imperial Edict)

14:42.520 --> 14:43.920
(A nation's strength lies)

14:44.440 --> 14:45.600
(in the clarity of its laws.)

14:46.280 --> 14:47.360
(When justice is clouded,)

14:47.680 --> 14:49.040
(evil thrives,)

14:49.560 --> 14:50.800
(and the loyal suffer.)

14:52.880 --> 14:54.360
(Now that the truth is revealed,)

14:54.960 --> 14:56.200
(I hereby decree.)

14:57.720 --> 14:59.560
(Xie Guanyu and his kin)

14:59.800 --> 15:01.280
(were indeed wrongfully accused)

15:01.720 --> 15:03.160
(and framed.)

15:04.880 --> 15:07.880
(Xie Guanyu's former ranks
and titles are restored.)

15:08.240 --> 15:10.160
(Consort Shu
shall be posthumously titled "Yi",)

15:10.680 --> 15:11.680
(to honor her virtue.)

15:11.760 --> 15:13.720
(Xie Residence)

15:13.800 --> 15:14.880
(Let this be proclaimed)

15:15.880 --> 15:17.240
(across the land.)

15:23.760 --> 15:24.720
(Father. Mother.)

15:26.200 --> 15:27.760
(I have cleared our family's name.)

15:29.440 --> 15:30.800
(May your spirits)

15:32.000 --> 15:33.000
(finally rest in peace.)

15:35.080 --> 15:39.440
(Xie Residence)

15:52.360 --> 15:53.480
Have you paid your respects?

15:55.520 --> 15:57.080
I think Uncle's spirit

15:57.800 --> 15:59.720
can rest in peace now.

16:01.080 --> 16:02.840
Zaiye, are you really leaving?

16:03.400 --> 16:04.320
I don't want you to go.

16:04.720 --> 16:06.360
Wuxia doesn't want you to go either.

16:07.240 --> 16:07.840
Right?

16:09.240 --> 16:10.600
Say something, you block of wood.

16:11.120 --> 16:13.080
Qingying, don't make a scene.

16:14.080 --> 16:15.520
Taohua has already gone to Beiyuan.

16:15.960 --> 16:16.880
She's waiting for me.

16:18.200 --> 16:19.760
Then promise you'll come visit often.

16:20.280 --> 16:22.280
Or better yet, we'll come visit you.

16:22.760 --> 16:24.080
Mu Wuxia, will you go with me?

16:26.840 --> 16:27.680
Wuxia's going

16:28.280 --> 16:29.480
to be the Crown Prince soon.

16:30.200 --> 16:31.880
He can't just enter
another state like that.

16:33.560 --> 16:34.440
As for you, Qingying,

16:35.280 --> 16:36.160
you need to grow up.

16:37.080 --> 16:38.800
You're about to become
the Crown Princess.

16:40.240 --> 16:42.120
Then you need to settle down too.

16:42.200 --> 16:43.680
You're about to be a Prince Consort.

16:47.440 --> 16:51.360
Wuxia, Qingying lost her father
at a young age, and I've spoiled her.

16:52.200 --> 16:53.760
You'll need to keep her in check.

16:53.840 --> 16:55.200
There's no need to hold back.

16:56.600 --> 16:57.640
I understand, Jing'an.

16:58.120 --> 16:58.920
You wouldn't dare.

17:05.760 --> 17:08.720
Jing'an, there will always be a place
for you in Qi.

17:12.960 --> 17:15.640
I've lived under a false name
and endured humiliation all these years

17:16.640 --> 17:17.400
for two reasons.

17:18.480 --> 17:20.800
First, to clear the Xie family's name

17:21.480 --> 17:22.839
from the witchcraft case,

17:24.160 --> 17:26.640
and to help you grow strong enough

17:27.440 --> 17:28.480
to rule.

17:29.400 --> 17:30.120
For ten years,

17:30.880 --> 17:31.640
I gave everything

17:32.720 --> 17:33.400
as a subject,

17:34.480 --> 17:35.080
a son,

17:36.360 --> 17:37.360
and an elder brother.

17:38.000 --> 17:38.760
I have no regrets.

17:40.800 --> 17:42.080
Now that justice has been done,

17:42.960 --> 17:43.560
and

17:43.920 --> 17:45.400
you are soon to become Crown Prince,

17:46.440 --> 17:47.240
my only wish

17:48.440 --> 17:49.960
is to keep Taohua safe,

17:51.120 --> 17:54.800
find a quiet place away from the world,
and grow old with her.

17:57.080 --> 17:57.800
Then

17:58.840 --> 18:00.720
I hope you and Taohua will take care

18:01.640 --> 18:02.840
and live the life you deserve.

18:05.320 --> 18:06.280
The road ahead is long.

18:07.240 --> 18:10.480
Qi will depend on you now.

18:29.520 --> 18:33.400
(Beiyuan Palace)

18:52.760 --> 18:53.360
Cui Wei,

18:53.920 --> 18:55.240
your efforts were key

18:55.560 --> 18:56.360
to my safe return.

18:57.400 --> 18:58.680
You're too kind, Your Highness.

19:00.040 --> 19:02.200
After Your Highness met
with Mu Wuyin that day,

19:02.560 --> 19:03.560
we lost all trace of you

19:03.840 --> 19:04.840
in Luocheng.

19:05.640 --> 19:06.680
So I sent riders

19:07.160 --> 19:08.480
to Qi State to search for you.

19:08.800 --> 19:09.400
Thankfully,

19:09.840 --> 19:10.720
they succeeded

19:11.240 --> 19:11.920
and found you.

19:12.840 --> 19:14.840
Everyone thought
I perished in that fire.

19:16.320 --> 19:18.400
But there was a hidden passage
beneath my chamber.

19:19.120 --> 19:20.040
That's how I escaped

19:20.120 --> 19:22.440
the capital of Qi State back then
without anyone noticing.

19:23.400 --> 19:24.080
And now,

19:25.240 --> 19:26.760
that same passage saved my life again.

19:47.480 --> 19:49.080
Your Highness is blessed by the heavens.

19:49.400 --> 19:50.760
Naturally, no danger can harm you.

19:51.280 --> 19:52.680
While I've been away,

19:53.400 --> 19:54.560
what has happened in Hao City?

19:55.400 --> 19:56.000
Your Highness,

19:57.240 --> 19:59.240
Jiang Changjue has arrived in the city.

20:00.400 --> 20:01.000
Our spies found

20:01.080 --> 20:03.240
he has been in secret contact
with the State Preceptor

20:04.080 --> 20:05.680
and Deputy Chief Yue.

20:09.160 --> 20:10.680
They plan to install a new ruler

20:11.280 --> 20:12.440
at tomorrow's court session.

20:14.400 --> 20:15.320
Jiang Changjue

20:15.440 --> 20:16.760
is staying at a residence arranged

20:16.840 --> 20:18.400
by Deputy Chief Yue.

20:18.520 --> 20:20.560
Take men and eliminate
Jiang Changjue immediately.

20:21.560 --> 20:22.960
Bring me his head.

20:24.240 --> 20:25.040
Yes, Your Highness.

20:32.840 --> 20:33.840
The news from Qi says

20:34.440 --> 20:37.440
Empress Lv and Mu Wuyin

20:38.480 --> 20:39.640
both perished in the fire.

20:41.400 --> 20:44.600
I've already requested Deputy Chief Yue
to summon the officials who support us.

20:44.920 --> 20:47.480
We'll change the tides of this state
at tomorrow's court session.

21:04.080 --> 21:06.040
Your Highness,
there's a group of strangers outside.

21:06.120 --> 21:07.680
The one leading them looks like Cui Wei.

21:08.400 --> 21:10.320
Your Highness,
this place is no longer safe.

21:10.400 --> 21:11.560
We'll leave through the back.

21:14.080 --> 21:14.680
Quick.

21:21.200 --> 21:22.520
Commander Cui, they've escaped.

21:32.640 --> 21:35.040
Here's what we'll do.
You all go hide in the secret chamber.

21:35.120 --> 21:36.760
I'll head out to alert Deputy Chief Yue.

21:37.080 --> 21:38.880
Your Highness, let me come with you.

21:39.040 --> 21:40.240
You're attending court tomorrow.

21:40.320 --> 21:41.960
We can't risk anything happening to you.

21:43.400 --> 21:44.200
All right, that works.

21:44.280 --> 21:45.400
The rest of you, follow me!

21:46.480 --> 21:47.080
Let's go.

22:05.880 --> 22:07.160
Why did you betray me?

22:07.240 --> 22:10.280
Men die for wealth,
just as birds die for food.

22:20.480 --> 22:21.760
Hurry! Don't let him get away!

22:31.480 --> 22:32.760
Commander Cui, the spy we planted

22:32.840 --> 22:34.280
with Jiang Changjue, is dead.

22:34.880 --> 22:35.840
Useless fool.

22:36.480 --> 22:38.480
Commander Cui,
he seems to have gone that way.

22:38.880 --> 22:39.480
After him.

22:40.240 --> 22:42.600
If we lose him, how am I supposed to
explain to Her Highness?

22:43.400 --> 22:45.960
Send some men to stake out
Deputy Chief Yue's residence.

22:46.240 --> 22:47.440
If Jiang Changjue shows up,

22:47.760 --> 22:48.560
seize him immediately.

22:48.640 --> 22:49.760
Split up and go after him.

22:53.560 --> 22:55.040
(Empress Lv is still alive?)

23:00.040 --> 23:01.640
Her Highness arrives!

23:06.400 --> 23:09.560
- Peace and blessings, Your Highness.
- Peace and blessings, Your Highness.

23:10.200 --> 23:11.680
I'm here to attend to His Majesty.

23:12.600 --> 23:13.200
You may leave.

23:13.560 --> 23:15.360
- Yes, Your Highness.
- Yes, Your Highness.

23:15.680 --> 23:16.560
Stay.

23:17.240 --> 23:18.760
I'm ordering you to stay.

23:20.080 --> 23:21.120
Stay…

23:30.600 --> 23:31.800
You were once

23:32.280 --> 23:34.080
a charismatic, charming,

23:34.520 --> 23:35.960
and commanding ruler.

23:36.640 --> 23:38.680
Now look at how you have fallen
to such a disgrace,

23:39.480 --> 23:41.080
it's hard to even bear the sight.

23:47.280 --> 23:47.880
I…

23:48.160 --> 23:51.560
(Emperor of Beiyuan)
I have treated you well.

23:51.840 --> 23:53.000
Don't forget

23:54.080 --> 23:54.800
that

23:55.920 --> 23:58.800
you were just a dancer
from Liufang Court.

24:00.000 --> 24:01.120
You're right, Your Majesty.

24:02.240 --> 24:03.320
You did treat me well.

24:05.840 --> 24:07.120
I came from humble origins.

24:07.360 --> 24:08.840
I was humiliated in Qi.

24:09.640 --> 24:11.760
Then I fled to Beiyuan,
where I ended up as a dancer.

24:13.240 --> 24:15.840
I twisted my ankle
and couldn't perform one night.

24:16.960 --> 24:18.360
A distinguished guest ordered me

24:19.360 --> 24:22.240
to stand barefoot on ice to heal.

24:23.160 --> 24:23.920
From that night on,

24:24.360 --> 24:25.520
I could never dance again

24:25.760 --> 24:26.800
and lost my livelihood.

24:28.120 --> 24:29.400
My body was ruined by the cold,

24:29.800 --> 24:31.240
and I could never bear children.

24:32.320 --> 24:34.440
Even my last hope of marrying into

24:34.920 --> 24:37.240
a decent family was shattered
by the cruelty of Beiyuan.

24:38.680 --> 24:40.480
I searched far and wide

24:41.960 --> 24:45.080
and finally discovered
that distinguished guest that night

24:47.520 --> 24:48.680
was you,

24:49.280 --> 24:49.960
Your Majesty.

24:54.240 --> 24:54.840
I

24:56.000 --> 24:57.520
don't remember.

25:05.960 --> 25:06.560
Medicine…

25:07.320 --> 25:07.920
Medicine.

25:22.240 --> 25:22.840
Your Majesty,

25:24.280 --> 25:26.840
savor this despair.

25:28.720 --> 25:30.680
It's what I felt back then.

25:35.320 --> 25:35.920
Are…

25:36.600 --> 25:38.400
Are you out of your mind?

25:43.160 --> 25:44.240
To get revenge,

25:44.600 --> 25:46.120
I got close to you.

25:46.280 --> 25:47.840
I flattered and schemed without shame

25:48.400 --> 25:50.840
until you gave me status.

25:51.680 --> 25:52.840
Wasn't

25:54.440 --> 25:57.560
that enough?

25:57.680 --> 25:58.800
How is that enough?

26:00.440 --> 26:01.760
Then I took hold of court affairs

26:01.840 --> 26:03.200
and ruled from behind the curtain.

26:03.960 --> 26:05.600
I never thought
it would bring me the joy

26:06.600 --> 26:08.400
I had never known before.

26:09.640 --> 26:10.680
Life and death hang on

26:12.160 --> 26:13.600
the stroke of a brush.

26:18.000 --> 26:19.120
I, Lv Yuanhua,

26:21.080 --> 26:22.880
no longer had to be trampled on.

26:25.360 --> 26:27.200
They dread me and fear me.

26:29.360 --> 26:31.720
For nearly a decade, I've held power.

26:32.840 --> 26:34.040
This throne

26:35.240 --> 26:36.600
should have been mine long ago.

26:39.440 --> 26:40.040
You…

26:41.080 --> 26:42.960
You vile woman.

26:45.440 --> 26:46.480
Someone…

26:47.200 --> 26:48.640
Help…

26:50.240 --> 26:51.360
Someone…

26:51.720 --> 26:52.960
Save me.

26:53.400 --> 26:55.080
Once I take the throne,

26:55.840 --> 26:57.120
I'll wipe out

26:57.720 --> 26:59.080
every last one of your Jiang clan.

26:59.800 --> 27:00.960
Not a single one shall remain.

27:16.080 --> 27:18.400
(Hao City, Beiyuan Capital City)

27:20.400 --> 27:25.120
(Hao City)

27:25.200 --> 27:26.480
Miss, come and take a look.

27:27.680 --> 27:28.320
Let's go.

27:28.560 --> 27:29.240
Zhan Lu, look.

27:29.720 --> 27:31.600
That's our famous Hao City wine.

27:32.240 --> 27:32.840
And over there.

27:33.440 --> 27:34.200
I said, look.

27:42.280 --> 27:43.480
(Hao City's streets and alleys)

27:43.560 --> 27:46.360
- (look just as I remembered.)
- That's it.

27:46.480 --> 27:47.080
Push him.

27:49.840 --> 27:50.440
(Empress Lv,)

27:51.920 --> 27:53.680
(this was the freedom I dreamt of)

27:55.000 --> 27:57.080
(when you locked me up back then.)

28:01.400 --> 28:02.000
(But now,)

28:03.400 --> 28:04.840
(your ambition and cruelty)

28:05.800 --> 28:07.440
(have all been burned to ashes.)

28:09.840 --> 28:10.760
(This time,)

28:12.800 --> 28:15.160
(nothing will stop Changjue and me)

28:17.160 --> 28:19.080
(from reclaiming what's ours.)

28:27.280 --> 28:28.840
(Postal Inn)

28:39.720 --> 28:41.680
Her Highness has arrived!

29:04.600 --> 29:06.520
My dear ministers, it's been a while.

29:07.080 --> 29:08.120
How have you all been?

29:08.520 --> 29:11.400
- Peace and blessings, Your Highness.
- Peace and blessings, Your Highness.

29:13.680 --> 29:15.200
I have returned safe and sound.

29:17.000 --> 29:18.080
What's with

29:18.840 --> 29:20.000
the long faces?

29:21.360 --> 29:22.320
Don't tell me

29:22.640 --> 29:25.360
(Yue Xingming, Deputy Chief Censor)
you're disappointed.

29:25.800 --> 29:28.040
I heard that when Jiang Changjue
first arrived in Hao City,

29:28.120 --> 29:30.320
the first person he approached
was you, State Preceptor.

29:30.440 --> 29:33.280
(Qian Mochen, Beiyuan State Preceptor)
The messenger he sent was beaten out

29:33.360 --> 29:34.280
of my residence

29:34.440 --> 29:35.200
by my orders.

29:36.080 --> 29:39.040
At that time,
Commander Cui happened to be present.

29:39.680 --> 29:40.680
He can vouch for me.

29:46.280 --> 29:48.880
Since today's assembly is
to determine the new ruler,

29:50.480 --> 29:51.760
who would like to speak first?

29:58.880 --> 29:59.480
Your Highness.

30:00.080 --> 30:03.320
Since no one else steps forward,
allow me.

30:03.920 --> 30:05.080
Commander Cui, please speak.

30:05.560 --> 30:06.160
Your Highness.

30:06.960 --> 30:09.320
For over a decade,
His Majesty had been gravely ill.

30:10.200 --> 30:13.400
The affairs of state have rested
on your shoulders.

30:14.240 --> 30:17.560
Now, for the stability of the court
and the will of the people,

30:18.160 --> 30:21.080
you should follow the will
of heaven and the people

30:21.680 --> 30:23.440
and take the reins.

30:25.120 --> 30:26.360
This is outrageous.

30:26.480 --> 30:27.480
It's usurping the throne!

30:31.080 --> 30:34.200
Your Highness, not once in history

30:34.680 --> 30:36.480
has a woman taken the throne.

30:37.280 --> 30:41.120
His Majesty would never give
the throne to you.

30:41.720 --> 30:43.960
I request to see His Majesty.

30:44.560 --> 30:47.240
- I request to see His Majesty.
- I request to see His Majesty.

30:48.640 --> 30:49.840
Oh, did I forget to mention?

30:50.840 --> 30:52.640
His Majesty passed away last night.

30:54.000 --> 30:54.600
What?

30:55.240 --> 30:58.640
The Crown Prince, Jiang Changjue,
died in unfortunate circumstances.

31:01.680 --> 31:04.920
Your Highness,
without an official decree of succession,

31:06.080 --> 31:08.080
we will never recognize you as ruler.

31:08.560 --> 31:09.520
Commander Cui,

31:10.160 --> 31:12.320
I've grown tired
of Deputy Chief Yue's endless prattle.

31:12.760 --> 31:13.600
He's annoyingly loud.

31:17.160 --> 31:19.240
Deputy Chief Yue has insulted
Her Highness.

31:20.000 --> 31:21.440
Take him away and have him executed!

31:23.920 --> 31:24.520
This…

31:24.680 --> 31:26.400
If my death can uphold justice,

31:26.600 --> 31:27.800
then let it be so!

31:28.440 --> 31:31.840
You evil empress,
you will not die a good death!

31:32.640 --> 31:33.560
As for the rest of you,

31:34.080 --> 31:35.240
any more objections?

31:36.800 --> 31:39.560
- Please show mercy, Your Highness!
- Please show mercy, Your Highness!

31:41.760 --> 31:43.600
I suggest you all know your place.

31:43.840 --> 31:46.240
Do not play with fire,
or your future will suffer.

31:47.040 --> 31:47.920
You're all dismissed.

31:48.000 --> 31:50.200
- Thank you, Your Highness.
- Thank you, Your Highness.

31:54.240 --> 31:55.280
State Preceptor, stay.

31:55.720 --> 31:56.680
Step forward.

32:02.840 --> 32:03.600
Yes, Your Highness.

32:04.840 --> 32:05.920
If I recall correctly,

32:06.520 --> 32:07.840
your poison is about to flare up.

32:13.200 --> 32:15.400
So I trust you know time is short.

32:16.560 --> 32:19.160
Choose an auspicious date
for my coronation immediately.

32:19.800 --> 32:22.080
Yes, I'll do all I can.

32:26.240 --> 32:27.720
(Postal Inn)

32:27.800 --> 32:29.240
Word just came from the palace.

32:29.920 --> 32:32.640
They say the Emperor of Beiyuan
passed away last night.

32:35.000 --> 32:36.040
What do we do now?

32:36.680 --> 32:37.680
The Emperor is now dead,

32:37.760 --> 32:39.240
and the Crown Prince is also missing.

32:40.200 --> 32:41.920
Beiyuan has truly descended into chaos.

32:42.640 --> 32:43.240
Zhan Lu,

32:43.400 --> 32:44.920
have they verified it?

32:45.000 --> 32:46.240
Could there have been a mistake?

32:47.320 --> 32:48.240
No, there's no mistake.

32:49.080 --> 32:51.040
We were all fooled
by Empress Lv's decoy.

32:51.840 --> 32:52.440
No one knows

32:52.520 --> 32:53.760
how she made it back to Beiyuan.

32:57.840 --> 32:59.680
How am I supposed to break this
to the Princess?

33:01.840 --> 33:03.360
Your Highness…

33:07.440 --> 33:08.120
Your Highness.

33:10.440 --> 33:11.640
I've heard everything.

33:13.160 --> 33:13.760
Right now,

33:14.680 --> 33:16.360
the priority is to locate Changjue.

33:18.720 --> 33:20.160
Let's go and speak to Qian Mochen.

33:24.240 --> 33:25.760
We've located Qian Mochen's whereabouts.

33:25.840 --> 33:27.120
So we're here to report it to you.

33:27.200 --> 33:28.240
All right. You can leave now.

33:28.320 --> 33:29.080
Yes, Your Highness.

34:16.880 --> 34:17.920
Greetings, Your Highness.

34:18.719 --> 34:19.920
Thanks to you, State Preceptor,

34:20.320 --> 34:22.920
I was cast out of my homeland
and forced into a political marriage.

34:23.600 --> 34:25.520
I'm hardly worthy
of the title "Princess" anymore.

34:26.320 --> 34:28.040
Did you return home

34:28.840 --> 34:31.000
just to condemn your master's betrayal?

34:33.800 --> 34:35.960
If you want to eat, you should pay up.

34:36.440 --> 34:37.360
You should be grateful

34:37.600 --> 34:39.400
I even bothered
to take this lousy silver lock.

34:40.080 --> 34:40.679
Hand it over!

34:40.760 --> 34:43.199
Mother gave this lock to Taohua!

34:43.280 --> 34:44.480
- Let go!
- Give it to me, brat!

34:45.920 --> 34:46.639
Changjue,

34:47.400 --> 34:48.120
are you all right?

34:48.639 --> 34:49.480
Taohua,

34:49.880 --> 34:53.719
why isn't Father protecting us?

34:54.040 --> 34:56.679
What did we do wrong?

34:57.560 --> 34:59.120
I'll be good, I promise.

35:05.280 --> 35:06.480
I got your longevity lock back.

35:08.160 --> 35:08.840
It's yours again.

35:13.800 --> 35:14.560
Who are you?

35:15.120 --> 35:15.720
I'm Qian

35:16.200 --> 35:16.800
Mochen.

35:17.720 --> 35:19.280
I'm just a wanderer

35:20.120 --> 35:21.800
who once received Empress Helan's favor.

35:22.040 --> 35:23.120
Now I return to repay her.

35:24.840 --> 35:25.600
My mother…

35:27.120 --> 35:28.520
She's gone.

35:37.920 --> 35:39.040
Then let me stay by your side

35:40.680 --> 35:41.840
until you're strong enough

35:42.480 --> 35:43.400
to protect yourselves.

35:45.080 --> 35:46.200
But this is the palace.

35:46.680 --> 35:48.280
It won't be easy for you to get back in.

35:50.840 --> 35:53.880
Though my knowledge of the scriptures
and ancient astronomy is limited,

35:54.240 --> 35:55.680
I've been appointed State Preceptor.

35:56.560 --> 35:59.040
Then may we take you as our teacher?

36:01.760 --> 36:02.880
Just what I had in mind.

36:12.000 --> 36:13.760
I came to find you for Changjue.

36:14.480 --> 36:16.880
I've searched the city for days,
but he's nowhere to be found.

36:17.280 --> 36:18.880
Does this have anything to do with you?

36:19.800 --> 36:20.680
Do you know

36:20.880 --> 36:21.960
Empress Lv is still alive?

36:22.560 --> 36:23.760
She intends to take the throne.

36:25.520 --> 36:28.440
Then that makes it all the more urgent
to find Changjue.

36:29.800 --> 36:31.400
Tell me where he is.

36:34.480 --> 36:35.120
I don't know.

36:36.120 --> 36:36.720
But

36:37.280 --> 36:39.200
I've already sent people out
to search for him.

36:39.280 --> 36:40.840
Didn't know you had such a good heart.

36:41.520 --> 36:42.920
Have you heard about His Majesty?

36:46.080 --> 36:46.920
I know he has passed.

36:48.120 --> 36:49.000
Since you already know,

36:49.080 --> 36:50.160
there's something important

36:50.680 --> 36:52.040
I must give you.

36:53.400 --> 36:54.000
What is it?

36:54.920 --> 36:57.000
The late Emperor's edict
to pass the throne to Changjue

36:59.600 --> 37:00.400
is in my residence.

37:22.640 --> 37:25.840
♪The flower bloomed,
knowing nothing at all♪

37:25.920 --> 37:28.960
♪In splendor, proud and tall♪

37:29.880 --> 37:33.000
♪The flower fell, lashed by the wind♪

37:33.120 --> 37:36.880
♪In a daze,
it felt like lifetimes had thinned♪

37:37.160 --> 37:40.240
♪Petals soaked in rain♪

37:40.360 --> 37:43.680
♪Heartbreak follows again and again♪

37:44.080 --> 37:47.640
♪The flower weeps, burdened by thoughts♪

37:47.720 --> 37:53.440
♪With no one it can be brought♪

37:58.400 --> 38:05.320
♪Wishes struggle through the mire♪

38:05.760 --> 38:12.600
♪Regrets clash in hopeless fire♪

38:13.080 --> 38:20.080
♪Still I hope she'll pick the flower
kissed by dew♪

38:20.400 --> 38:24.440
♪Even if it means this flower♪

38:24.560 --> 38:31.520
♪Will be hers to give to someone new♪

38:42.640 --> 38:45.760
♪Whose eyes
did the flower's heart meet?♪

38:45.840 --> 38:49.080
♪Love and hate held back, discreet♪

38:49.440 --> 38:53.120
♪The flower withers, feelings in decay♪

38:53.240 --> 38:59.800
♪No longer needing to say♪

39:03.880 --> 39:10.800
♪Yet I still long for her in madness♪

39:11.200 --> 39:18.160
♪Unafraid of judgment or sadness♪

39:18.520 --> 39:25.520
♪Remembering the words
she spoke of flowers and skies♪

39:25.880 --> 39:27.560
♪And finding♪

39:27.640 --> 39:34.640
♪They were her gentle heart's reply♪
